{"id":"840f660beff00433","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/563_混合逻辑_H_@_.md","title":"563 混合逻辑 H @ ","display":"563_混合逻辑_H_@_","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}=\\{n_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}=\\{n_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{sat}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{sat}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示约定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\ni=\\operatorname{nom}(i),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\ni=\\operatorname{nom}(i),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\\qquad\n@_iA=\\operatorname{sat}(i,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\\qquad\n@_iA=\\operatorname{sat}(i,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\">\\(\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\">\\(A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>命题变元函数与名元出现函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Nom}_{563})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Nom}_{563})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中实际子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(i)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(i)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(@_iA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(@_iA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(p)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(i)=\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(p)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(i)=\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(@_iA)=\\{i\\}\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(@_iA)=\\{i\\}\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{563}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{563}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,563}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,563}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{563}=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{563}=\\operatorname{NV}_{563}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{563}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{563}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{563}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{563}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(i,\\sigma)=i,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(i,\\sigma)=i,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(@_iA,\\sigma)=@_i\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(@_iA,\\sigma)=@_i\\operatorname{Sub}_{563}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{563}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{563}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{563}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{563}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{563}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{563}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{563}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{563}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态与混合公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{563}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{563}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{563}=\\{@_ii:i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{563}=\\{@_ii:i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatK}^{563}=\\{@_i(A\\to B)\\to(@_iA\\to@_iB):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatK}^{563}=\\{@_i(A\\to B)\\to(@_iA\\to@_iB):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatSelf}^{563}=\\{@_iA\\to(i\\to A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatSelf}^{563}=\\{@_iA\\to(i\\to A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{563}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{563}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{563}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatK}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatSelf}^{563}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{563}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{563}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{563}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatK}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SatSelf}^{563}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Name 规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563}=\\{((i\\to A),A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563},i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563}=\\{((i\\to A),A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563},i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则显示与规则总关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (\\mathsf{MP}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (\\mathsf{Nec}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{i\\to A}{A}\\ (\\mathsf{Name}),\\quad i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (\\mathsf{MP}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (\\mathsf{Nec}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{i\\to A}{A}\\ (\\mathsf{Name}),\\quad i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{563}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{563}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{563}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\">\\(((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\)</span>，且每行至少满足下列 5 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{563}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{563}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{563}((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\n=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{563}((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\n=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{563}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{563}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{563}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{563}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{563}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{563}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{563}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{563}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-混合局部性证书\">8. 混合局部性证书</h1>\n<p>定义完整推导证书集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{563}\n=\\{(\\Gamma,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{563},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}(\\Gamma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{563}\n=\\{(\\Gamma,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{563},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}(\\Gamma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Name 行的见证名元、新鲜性和空依赖条件均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{563}\\)</span> 的第 5 类行条件决定，因而证书合法性不依赖额外的自然语言谓词。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-混合-Kripke-语义载体与后承\">9. 混合 Kripke 语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>混合模型集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HMod}_{563}\n=\n\\{(W,R,g,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W,\\ g:\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\\to W,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HMod}_{563}\n=\n\\{(W,R,g,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W,\\ g:\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}\\to W,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{563}\">\\(M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{563}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{563}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{563}\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\Longleftrightarrow w=g(i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{563}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{563}\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\Longleftrightarrow w=g(i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\not\\models_{563}\\bot,\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{563}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{563}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\not\\models_{563}\\bot,\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{563}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{563}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{563}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{563}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{563}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{563}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{563}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{563}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{563}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{563}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{563}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{563}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{563}@_iA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,g(i)\\models_{563}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{563}@_iA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,g(i)\\models_{563}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{563}^{\\mathsf H}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{563}^{\\mathsf H}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{563}\">\\(M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{563}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{563}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{563}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{563}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{563}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是满意算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"@_iA\">\\(@_iA\\)</span> 与 Name 规则；它没有第 564 条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow x.A\">\\(\\downarrow x.A\\)</span> 绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal HAt_{563}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{563},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563},\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563},\n\\operatorname{FN}_{563},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{563},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,563},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{563},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{563},\n\\operatorname{last}_{563},\n\\vdash_{563},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{563},\n\\mathsf{HMod}_{563},\n\\models_{563},\n\\models_{563}^{\\mathsf H}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal HAt_{563}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{563},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563},\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563},\n\\operatorname{FN}_{563},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{563},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,563},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{563},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{563},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{563},\n\\operatorname{last}_{563},\n\\vdash_{563},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{563},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{563},\n\\mathsf{HMod}_{563},\n\\models_{563},\n\\models_{563}^{\\mathsf H}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含带满意算子的混合逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、带名元赋值的 Kripke 模型和语义后承；不含双模拟理论或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由符号与替换","text":"3. 自由符号与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-混合局部性证书","text":"8. 混合局部性证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-混合-Kripke-语义载体与后承","text":"9. 混合 Kripke 语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}=\\{n_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{sat}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\ni=\\operatorname{nom}(i),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\\qquad\n@_iA=\\operatorname{sat}(i,A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{563}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{563}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{563}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Nom}_{563})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(i)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{563}(A\\to